   }
  },
  {
   "turn": 3,
   "response_text": "The logs show the training completed successfully, but the validation accuracy is consistently around 0.90, which is significantly higher than the expected healthy range of 0.8519\u20130.8607. Let me look at the training code to understand what might be causing this:",
